(5879033, 855722, 67258, '<td valign="top">An interesting study of textures - I do , though, find that the twigs in the foreground break up the flow.</td>', 'An interesting study of textures - I do , though, find that the twigs in the foreground break up the flow.', '2010-02-24 08:14:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5879034, 856273, 10785, '<td valign="top">Very good composition. I like the open gate and the peek into the statue. It is pretty blown out and over exposed though. I don''t know if you used manual or automatic settings but I would try increasing the shutter speed to allow less light to pass through to the sensor. Possibly try framing the shot so the columns fill the left and right border to the top getting rid of the white sky. All in all a very creative shot!</td>', 'Very good composition. I like the open gate and the peek into the statue. It is pretty blown out and over exposed though. I don''t know if you used manual or automatic settings but I would try increasing the shutter speed to allow less light to pass through to the sensor. Possibly try framing the shot so the columns fill the left and right border to the top getting rid of the white sky. All in all a very creative shot!', '2010-02-24 08:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5879035, 856301, 10785, '<td valign="top">A hard scene to expose for with the shade and sun areas.</td>', 'A hard scene to expose for with the shade and sun areas.', '2010-02-24 08:18:59.000000', NULL, 1),
