(5882375, 856251, 67258, '<td valign="top">Quite extraordinary - a very well conceived and executed photo, and in my personal top 3 of the challenge.  Bumping to 10.</td>', 'Quite extraordinary - a very well conceived and executed photo, and in my personal top 3 of the challenge.  Bumping to 10.', '2010-02-27 03:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5882376, 856181, 67258, '<td valign="top">A super study in light, shape and form.</td>', 'A super study in light, shape and form.', '2010-02-27 03:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5882377, 856240, 67258, '<td valign="top">One of my favourites of the challenge.  The composition works well and the quirkiness makes me smile.  It would have been good if you had been able to bring out some more of the texture of the wooden fence.</td>', 'One of my favourites of the challenge.  The composition works well and the quirkiness makes me smile.  It would have been good if you had been able to bring out some more of the texture of the wooden fence.', '2010-02-27 03:45:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5882380, 856118, 67258, '<td valign="top">Now that is one heck of a lot of snow - love the almost studio like white on white effect.</td>', 'Now that is one heck of a lot of snow - love the almost studio like white on white effect.', '2010-02-27 03:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5882381, 856170, 67258, '<td valign="top">I love it!  The wine glasses are perfect!</td>', 'I love it!  The wine glasses are perfect!', '2010-02-27 03:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5882382, 854910, 67258, '<td valign="top">That''s fun! I love the apparant randomness of it, and the colour palette.</td>', 'That''s fun! I love the apparant randomness of it, and the colour palette.', '2010-02-27 03:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5882383, 856253, 67258, '<td valign="top">What a lovely garden abstract - the dew drops provide really interesting textural detail.  I wonder if it might have been worth desaturating the green, or cropping a bit tighter to the top of the ''arches'' as the leaf or blade of grass in the background is a bit distracting and takes away a little of the impact (or of course, I guess better still if you had spotted it in composing!)</td>', 'What a lovely garden abstract - the dew drops provide really interesting textural detail.  I wonder if it might have been worth desaturating the green, or cropping a bit tighter to the top of the ''arches'' as the leaf or blade of grass in the background is a bit distracting and takes away a little of the impact (or of course, I guess better still if you had spotted it in composing!)', '2010-02-27 03:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5882384, 856110, 67258, '<td valign="top">Lucky you! Super portrait of this cormorant in its typical wing drying pose.</td>', 'Lucky you! Super portrait of this cormorant in its typical wing drying pose.', '2010-02-27 03:48:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5882385, 855177, 67258, '<td valign="top">A ghostly image, which stirs me to want to create a back-story narrative.</td>', 'A ghostly image, which stirs me to want to create a back-story narrative.', '2010-02-27 03:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5882387, 856183, 67258, '<td valign="top">Among my top picks in the challenge.  The blur (lensbaby?) gives a good feeling of immediacy to the image.</td>', 'Among my top picks in the challenge.  The blur (lensbaby?) gives a good feeling of immediacy to the image.', '2010-02-27 03:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5882403, 856238, 83544, '<td valign="top">Everything in this photo is just perfect, the futuristic look, the vanishing point of the bridge, the blurry clouds, and the feeling of calmness looking at the park benches and grass, but in the end it''s not my kind of photo when I imagine something that should be in the garden, 7</td>', 'Everything in this photo is just perfect, the futuristic look, the vanishing point of the bridge, the blurry clouds, and the feeling of calmness looking at the park benches and grass, but in the end it''s not my kind of photo when I imagine something that should be in the garden, 7', '2010-02-27 05:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5882405, 856117, 83544, '<td valign="top">sooo you have a trash can in your garden? :) at least it looks like the bird is standing on one, and I''d say this is not a garden but a city park. But on the other hand nice sharpness of the subject and the white grayish background contributes the colorful bird to stand out, also the frame fits nice, 8</td>', 'sooo you have a trash can in your garden? :) at least it looks like the bird is standing on one, and I''d say this is not a garden but a city park. But on the other hand nice sharpness of the subject and the white grayish background contributes the colorful bird to stand out, also the frame fits nice, 8', '2010-02-27 06:06:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5882406, 856179, 83544, '<td valign="top">not sure if this shot is taken in a studio or a garden</td>', 'not sure if this shot is taken in a studio or a garden', '2010-02-27 06:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5882525, 856184, 554, '<td valign="top">Joe Dirt...the early years.</td>', 'Joe Dirt...the early years.', '2010-02-27 11:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5882526, 856039, 554, '<td valign="top">You are very observant</td>', 'You are very observant', '2010-02-27 11:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5882644, 855381, 70661, '<td valign="top">I wish I had one of these in my garden.</td>', 'I wish I had one of these in my garden.', '2010-02-27 14:31:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5882646, 855519, 70661, '<td valign="top">I love rust!</td>', 'I love rust!', '2010-02-27 14:33:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5882648, 856152, 70661, '<td valign="top">My fav so far!</td>', 'My fav so far!', '2010-02-27 14:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5882649, 855633, 70661, '<td valign="top">very pretty.</td>', 'very pretty.', '2010-02-27 14:37:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5882666, 855487, 49359, '<td valign="top">The blurry thumb is annoying me, but I like the idea. Would have been better with a model or self timer.</td>', 'The blurry thumb is annoying me, but I like the idea. Would have been better with a model or self timer.', '2010-02-27 15:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5882689, 856184, 111957, '<td valign="top">The subject is not clear enough here. There''s definitely a story going on, but its hard to tell what it is. Maybe isolating one part of it or cropping out unimportant elements might help with the story telling.</td>', 'The subject is not clear enough here. There''s definitely a story going on, but its hard to tell what it is. Maybe isolating one part of it or cropping out unimportant elements might help with the story telling.', '2010-02-27 16:42:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5882690, 855596, 111957, '<td valign="top">Love the lines.</td>', 'Love the lines.', '2010-02-27 16:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5882691, 855869, 111957, '<td valign="top">I''ll let it slide since it''s such a good macro shot of the bee, but it sure looks like a flower is part of the main subject...</td>', 'I''ll let it slide since it''s such a good macro shot of the bee, but it sure looks like a flower is part of the main subject...', '2010-02-27 16:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5882692, 855418, 111957, '<td valign="top">woah.</td>', 'woah.', '2010-02-27 16:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5882693, 855620, 111957, '<td valign="top">I really like the compo of this shot. All that empty space of blur really draws the eye to the sharp little snail. Cool.</td>', 'I really like the compo of this shot. All that empty space of blur really draws the eye to the sharp little snail. Cool.', '2010-02-27 16:48:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5882694, 855666, 111957, '<td valign="top">flower</td>', 'flower', '2010-02-27 16:49:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5882696, 855902, 111957, '<td valign="top">I really like the tonemapping in this. It makes the roots look like liquid. Nice work. What happened with the blown out sky though? I assume this is HDR, so you could have saved that...</td>', 'I really like the tonemapping in this. It makes the roots look like liquid. Nice work. What happened with the blown out sky though? I assume this is HDR, so you could have saved that...', '2010-02-27 16:50:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5882697, 854864, 111957, '<td valign="top">wonderful shot, but doesn''t meet the rules.</td>', 'wonderful shot, but doesn''t meet the rules.', '2010-02-27 16:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5882698, 856142, 111957, '<td valign="top">maybe waiting for later in the day would have helped this one along. The light is too stark.</td>', 'maybe waiting for later in the day would have helped this one along. The light is too stark.', '2010-02-27 16:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5882700, 855949, 111957, '<td valign="top">I''m really drawn to this one. Maybe it''s the repeating lines, or the sky, or the interaction of the reflection the posts and the sky. I can''t tell, but it intrigues me. I wish it was a little warmer, though. Maybe a little white balance tweak would help that....</td>', 'I''m really drawn to this one. Maybe it''s the repeating lines, or the sky, or the interaction of the reflection the posts and the sky. I can''t tell, but it intrigues me. I wish it was a little warmer, though. Maybe a little white balance tweak would help that....', '2010-02-27 16:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5882701, 856110, 111957, '<td valign="top">a little over exposed. Maybe bring it down a bit. It looks salvageable. Cool find, though!</td>', 'a little over exposed. Maybe bring it down a bit. It looks salvageable. Cool find, though!', '2010-02-27 16:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5882702, 855528, 111957, '<td valign="top">too many flowers, sorry.</td>', 'too many flowers, sorry.', '2010-02-27 16:57:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5882703, 854834, 111957, '<td valign="top">That is one ugly frog.</td>', 'That is one ugly frog.', '2010-02-27 17:00:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5882704, 855869, 49788, '<td valign="top">Wonderful tones and nice composition with background element echoing the foreground. I also like the warm reds / oranges contrasting with the greens. Would have liked to see a bit sharper focus on the bee''s eye. That said, one of the strongest images in this challenge. Well done.</td>', 'Wonderful tones and nice composition with background element echoing the foreground. I also like the warm reds / oranges contrasting with the greens. Would have liked to see a bit sharper focus on the bee''s eye. That said, one of the strongest images in this challenge. Well done.', '2010-02-27 17:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5882705, 855382, 111957, '<td valign="top">I''d have given it a 10 if it was taken later in the day. Seems a little bright. The colors are a bit washed out, but what a scene!</td>', 'I''d have given it a 10 if it was taken later in the day. Seems a little bright. The colors are a bit washed out, but what a scene!', '2010-02-27 17:01:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5882706, 856069, 111957, '<td valign="top">What is that? I can''t tell.</td>', 'What is that? I can''t tell.', '2010-02-27 17:02:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5882710, 855683, 111957, '<td valign="top">This is a tremendous capture! I had to give it a 4 because of the flower, but don''t take that as a comment about its quality. Nice work!</td>', 'This is a tremendous capture! I had to give it a 4 because of the flower, but don''t take that as a comment about its quality. Nice work!', '2010-02-27 17:06:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5882736, 855416, 38725, '<td valign="top">My favorite of the challenge, well done ;)</td>', 'My favorite of the challenge, well done ;)', '2010-02-27 18:01:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5882748, 856047, 28427, '<td valign="top">If I see this correctly, these aren''t real flowers.  Now, the challenge states, no flowers.  Would think that this will not be considered as a flower? Don''t know...</td>', 'If I see this correctly, these aren''t real flowers.  Now, the challenge states, no flowers.  Would think that this will not be considered as a flower? Don''t know...', '2010-02-27 18:17:38.000000', NULL, 1);
