(5885290, 856117, 108580, '<td valign="top">Great shot, almost flawless. I have a thing against feeding wildlife despite the harshness of the weather and the meager pickings they have at this time of year. It is inmho cheating taking such a photo. However the little bird could just be stealing from an outdoor bin? Still the image is well taken and the contrast between colourful bird and dreary winter is shown to it''s full benefit here. Composition is great. Focus excellent.</td>', 'Great shot, almost flawless. I have a thing against feeding wildlife despite the harshness of the weather and the meager pickings they have at this time of year. It is inmho cheating taking such a photo. However the little bird could just be stealing from an outdoor bin? Still the image is well taken and the contrast between colourful bird and dreary winter is shown to it''s full benefit here. Composition is great. Focus excellent.', '2010-03-01 14:38:22.000000', NULL, 1),
