(5888311, 855902, 98339, '<td valign="top">Nice HDR (I think)or Topaz??? I like what you did with the roots and trunk of the tree.  Perhaps just a touch of over sharpening in the tree to the left but then you can''t do a selective sharpening with Basic.  And I would agree that the sky is quite blown out...in advanced editing you could have applied a gradient map to have fixed that as well...</td>', 'Nice HDR (I think)or Topaz??? I like what you did with the roots and trunk of the tree.  Perhaps just a touch of over sharpening in the tree to the left but then you can''t do a selective sharpening with Basic.  And I would agree that the sky is quite blown out...in advanced editing you could have applied a gradient map to have fixed that as well...', '2010-03-03 09:48:15.000000', NULL, 0),
