(5889122, 855683, 27735, '<td valign="top">It''s amazing how the challenge descriptions are so often misinterpreted...<br/> <br/>Simple enough -- compose a photograph somehow related to the garden. Here''s the catch... <b>the main subject</b> of your photograph may NOT be a flower.<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by burfino:</b></div><hr/><i> This is a tremendous capture! I had to give it a 4 because of the flower, but don''t take that as a comment about its quality. Nice work! </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'It''s amazing how the challenge descriptions are so often misinterpreted... Simple enough -- compose a photograph somehow related to the garden. Here''s the catch... the main subject of your photograph may NOT be a flower. Originally posted by burfino: This is a tremendous capture! I had to give it a 4 because of the flower, but don''t take that as a comment about its quality. Nice work! ', '2010-03-03 16:50:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(5889143, 856128, 61961, '<td valign="top">I wondered which of my New York neighbors took this -- then I found it was from a visitor! I understand you used very little adjustment in pp, so I wonder if you had a red filter or something on your camera for this stunning shot.</td>', 'I wondered which of my New York neighbors took this -- then I found it was from a visitor! I understand you used very little adjustment in pp, so I wonder if you had a red filter or something on your camera for this stunning shot.', '2010-03-03 17:00:38.000000', NULL, 0),
